   "author": "Grace Gong",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gracegong_aiinference-aiinfrastructure-ai-activity-7517823237435609088-XVGY",
   "text": "AI INFERENCE COMPANIES (HIRING LIST)\n\nHere are 31 AI inference companies that are actively hiring right now, ranked by percentage headcount growth in the past 90 days. This is Week 135 of On My Radar, my weekly list of the companies I can't stop watching:\n\nTogether AI - full-stack AI cloud (San Francisco)\nGimlet Labs - serverless inference infrastructure (San Francisco)\nAcrab - edge AI compute platform for agents (Singapore)\nParasail - inference cloud for AI-native startups (San Mateo)\nai& - AI platform with built-in inference (Yokohama)\nPositron AI - inference hardware (Reno)\nPrime Intellect - decentralized training and inference (San Francisco)\nBaseten - inference platform for deploying mo",
