   "text": "The AI Chip War is Alive and Kicking!** \ud83e\udd2f\n\nTenstorrent, an upstart market competitor in AI inference chips, has just raised **$1.5 billion**, boosting its valuation to a staggering **$6.2 billion**! Just months after fielding acquisition interest from Intel and Qualcomm at up to **$5 billion**, Tenstorrent has more than **DOUBLED its valuation** from $2.6 billion in late 2024! \n\nCo-led by Trace Capital and Innovation X, confidence in their vision is sky-high. \u2728  \n\nCEO Jim Keller confirmed their strategy: independence to fuel the future of AI. The new funds will power development and deployment of chips for open-weight AI models and advanced video generation, directly targeting Nvidia's stron",
